[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 362.23, "timestamp": "00:06:02", "text": "游戏。看看Neco Jok。你好。享受。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 363.629, "timestamp": "00:06:03", "text": "去。晚安。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 366.105, "timestamp": "00:06:06", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"joq will not actually sleep and will either- 1. watch yt and listen music. 2. read manhwa/watch anime"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 367.59, "timestamp": "00:06:07", "text": "罗独自一人。我是一个坐着的魔鬼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 369.83, "timestamp": "00:06:09", "text": "在我身后，就像你在指引我一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 373.27, "timestamp": "00:06:13", "text": "你知道该怎么做之类的，因为他可以。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 374.932, "timestamp": "00:06:14", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "fr"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 375.749, "timestamp": "00:06:15", "text": "放我走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 380.309, "timestamp": "00:06:20", "text": "别那样解读我的话。哦，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 382.189, "timestamp": "00:06:22", "text": "对于那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 385.43, "timestamp": "00:06:25", "text": "我只是对直播做了一些小小的改动。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 385.689, "timestamp": "00:06:25", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "then wake up tired tomorrow"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 388.469, "timestamp": "00:06:28", "text": "覆盖。现在我们已经定好了日期，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 390.27, "timestamp": "00:06:30", "text": "日期是动态的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 391.926, "timestamp": "00:06:31", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "or 3. hangout with friends on discord chat with em"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 394.07, "timestamp": "00:06:34", "text": "实际上。所以每当我切换场景时，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 394.785, "timestamp": "00:06:34", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and do all this all over again"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 396.23, "timestamp": "00:06:36", "text": "呃，它会自动调整。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 398.30899999999997, "timestamp": "00:06:38", "text": "还有其他一些东西。我一直在尝试"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 401.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:06:41", "text": "最近直播板很火，而且有很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 404.469, "timestamp": "00:06:44", "text": "我们可以用它来做很多很酷的事情。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 407.15, "timestamp": "00:06:47", "text": "简直太不可思议了，我"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 410.718, "timestamp": "00:06:50", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "mhm"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 412.629, "timestamp": "00:06:52", "text": "从来没有真正好好地探索过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 415.51, "timestamp": "00:06:55", "text": "适当地。这就像，不，你觉得呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 417.909, "timestamp": "00:06:57", "text": "我有朋友。我的意思是，我有朋友。"}]